          "docs": "<p>Removes the specified dimension from your Amazon Web Services accounts.</p> <p>Requires permission to access the <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/service-authorization/latest/reference/list_awsiot.html#awsiot-actions-as-permissions\">DeleteDimension</a> action.</p>"
        },
